Date: Tue, 6 Oct 2026 14:17:49 -0300
Subject: [PATCH] feat(ui): add focus_follows_mouse option

Focus the pane under the mouse cursor as the mouse moves over it,
like tmux's focus-follows-mouse. Off by default.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
